<title>USA: MBIA guarantees $75.5 mln Phila. issue.</title>
<headline>MBIA guarantees $75.5 mln Phila. issue.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Inc's subsidiary MBIA Insurance Corp said Thursday it is guaranteeing a $75.5 million tax claim collateralized bond issue by the Philadelphia Authority for Industrial Development.</p>
<p>The Authority plans to issue $75.5 million par value of principal securities backed by $106.3 million of property tax liens owed to the City of Philadelphia and the School District of Philadelphia, MBIA said.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Group Inc is the lead underwriter and Public Financial Management Inc the financial adviser for the transaction, MBIA said.</p>
</text>
